# T-Mobile Official Website Guide

T-Mobile's official resources for wireless service, devices, internet, coverage, offers, business solutions, and customer support.

This is the main T-Mobile website at t-mobile.com. The linked pages in this file, not the file itself, are the source of truth for pricing, offers, eligibility, and availability.

## About T-Mobile

T-Mobile US, Inc. is an American wireless network operator providing mobile, home internet, and business connectivity services nationwide.

- https://www.t-mobile.com/

Key facts:

- Headquartered in Bellevue, Washington.
- Operates a nationwide 5G network, including fixed wireless home internet service.
- Trades on the Nasdaq stock exchange under the ticker symbol TMUS.
- Nationwide 5G network covers 98% of Americans, with Ultra Capacity (mid-band) 5G reaching 306 million people (based on 2H 2025 data).
- Named Best Mobile Network in the U.S. and Most Consistent Network in America by Ookla Speedtest, based on 2H 2025 data.
- Completed the acquisition of UScellular's wireless operations on August 1, 2025, and formed fiber joint ventures Lumos (completed April 1, 2025) and Metronet (completed July 24, 2025).
- Operates two main brands, T-Mobile and Metro by T-Mobile, alongside Mint Mobile and Ultra Mobile as separately operated acquired brands.


